<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> and his friends, conversely, don’t seem as affected as the rest, chatting and hanging about near the center of the pool. You think to yourself how it isn’t fair that some people can work out like that and hardly feel it while others, like the unfortunate <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span>, look on the verge of passing out. <span style="color:Yellow">The genetic lottery is a cruel game.</span> <br>

