:: Xavier Swimming Chicken 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
You only manage to take in a deep breath just in time, opening your eyes under the water to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> in front of you. <span style="color:Pink">He glances down and smirks. You quickly blush and try to cover yourself and surface, but then <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> dangles your trunks in front of you. You watch nervously as he swims towards your legs and slips your trunks back on, slowly pulling them up. You have no choice but to move your hands, giving him a front row viewing of your boyhood as he pulls your trunks the rest of the way up, patting your groin twice once you’re once again clothed.</span> <br>
